    participant User
    participant App
    participant Apple
    participant Backend

    User->>App: Tap sign in
    App->>Apple: Request auth
    Apple->>User: Show prompt
    User->>Apple: Authenticate
    Apple->>App: Return token
    App->>Backend: Send token
    Backend->>Apple: Verify token
    Apple->>Backend: Token valid
    Backend->>App: Login success
    App->>User: Go to dashboard
